**Memo: Project Update on Exploration and Infrastructure Development**

To: Sarah Thompson, Chief Operations Officer  
From: David Lin, Senior Project Manager  
Date: April 15, 2024  

As part of our ongoing partnership with Apex Energy Solutions, we have successfully completed the preliminary drilling phase in the Gulf of Mexico, identifying 150 million barrels of recoverable oil reserves near Block 256. The refining process is set to commence on May 2, 2024, at our Baton Rouge facility, which is equipped to handle the expected output of 25,000 barrels per day. Following this, the new pipeline system, designed in collaboration with TransTech Engineering, will be crucial for transporting crude to our refineries, ensuring a seamless integration of our exploration and production operations.